  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Community-Based NCD Management Capacity in Mirzapur, Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen primary healthcare services and enhance community awareness for managing hypertension and diabetes to improve the health of residents in Mirzapur, Bangladesh, specifically focusing on non communicable diseases (NCDs).1) &#xace0;&#xd608;&#xc555; &#xb2f9;&#xb1e8; &#xad00;&#xb9ac; 1&#xcc28; &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xc758;&#xb8cc;&#xc11c;&#xbe44;&#xc2a4; &#xac15;&#xd654;
2) &#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xace0;&#xd608;&#xc555; &#xb2f9;&#xb1e8; &#xad00;&#xb9ac; &#xc778;&#xc2dd; &#xac1c;&#xc120;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen primary healthcare services in Mirzapur, Bangladesh, the project aims to fisrt, train healthcare personnel, provide health facilities with, second, sufficient equipment and supplies for hypertension and diabetes screening and, third, adequate medication availability, fourth, establish an integrated data management system across primary healthcare facilities, and, fifth, host NCD forums to raise awareness among stakeholders. For community awareness enhancement, the project aims to conduct awareness campaigns, conduct hypertension and diabetes screenings, and organize patient self help groups to ensure the sustainable NCD management within the community.</narrative>
  </description>
